<p>Turkish officials said an eighth-grade student opened fire at a middle school in the Onikisubat district of Kahramanmaras on Wednesday, killing nine people — eight students and a teacher — and injuring 13 others. Earlier official counts had put the toll lower before authorities revised it upward. Authorities said the student used firearms believed to belong to his father, a former police officer. The shooting came a day after another school attack in Siverek, in southern Sanliurfa province, where an ex-student wounded 16 people before dying. It was the second such incident in Turkey in two days.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/QDzAkfK5vMZ9Paht1NZQDF-HCXGJKaOEKyxxEFg2TiBJljT7s7Wtbh1_ZEIgovPoJc0sIuStVdnJtl4HScobW3F0jw07_GFeBNOzte-vfwA03Pb4fRDYTdAY-g2RrCJt95M38s5qFhkKFQLBtBSLGQlXHsIBZri8JUzowkzjMrbOWUDEnadnOA3UMZs8VRw47xFpQliE7iTkOd5jlcjb2hJcVnqrV_j1R3OIu_FHZnADuzGpX7OkKaTvRI4iwUnCDPhEPXnlcm87MIfxaw' alt='People wait in front of the school building after a deadly shooting in Kahramanmaras, Turkey, on April 15, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Critical injuries: Interior Minister Mustafa Ciftci said six of the 13 wounded were in intensive care, and three of them were in critical condition.</li><li>Weapons carried: Governor Mukerrem Unluer said the attacker entered the school carrying five guns and seven magazines.</li><li>Same-school suspect: RT and Reuters/Al Monitor said the attacker was an eighth-grade student at the middle school he targeted.</li></ul><blockquote>We regret to report nine deaths (…) and 13 wounded. Six of them are currently in intensive care, three of whom are in critical condition - Interior Minister Mustafa Ciftci</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Governor Mukerrem Unluer: He said authorities believe the student took firearms from his father, entered two classrooms, and fired randomly, laying out the sequence investigators are examining. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/four-dead-after-turkeys-second-school-shooting-two-days'>Reuters via Al Monitor</a>)</li><li>Interior Minister Mustafa Ciftci: He updated the death toll and the condition of the injured, showing that the government was still reconciling casualty figures as victims were treated. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cn088n9e6e9o'>BBC</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.allsides.com/news/2026-04-15-0700/world-least-4-dead-second-school-shooting-turkey-two-days'>At Least 4 Dead in Second School Shooting in Turkey in Two Days</a> - allsides.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/15/four-killed-in-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-two-days'>At least nine people killed in Turkiye’s second school shooting in two days</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/turkey-school-shooting-kahramanmaras/'>Eighth grade student kills 4, wounds 20 in second Turkey school shooting in 2 days</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cn088n9e6e9o'>Nine killed in second Turkish school shooting in two days</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/1-dead-in-shooting-at-school-in-turkey-second-such-incident-in-24-hours-11361250#publisher=newsstand'>4 Dead In Shooting At School In Turkey, Second Such Incident In 24 Hours</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/638454-school-shooting-turkiye-kahramanmaras/'>Türkiye rocked by second school shooting in two days</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991984/nine-killed-13-wounded-after-school-shooting-in-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-2-days'>Nine killed, 13 wounded after school shooting in Turkiye’s second school shooting in 2 days</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/four-dead-after-turkeys-second-school-shooting-in-two-days'>13-year-old boy kills 4, wounds 20 in latest Turkey school shooting</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/15/four-d